 python3-pympacds (>= 0.2.0),
 python3-paho-mqtt
Description: MQTT client service for pympacds
 pympacds-mqtt maintains a single MQTT connection to a broker and exposes
 publish/subscribe over D-Bus, with automatic reconnection.
 .
 It uses paho-mqtt behind an internal asyncio shim and exports the MQTT
 contract (publish/send/subscribe/unsubscribe/reconnect/status) alongside
 the framework Health and Config contracts.
